Integration kit for original Quasar Bridge and OmniRoute releases.
This tree contains an integration delta patch, not a vendored service source tree.
Quasar Bridge is downloaded from skrashevich/quasar-bridge and modified at build
with native acknowledgement cache, configurable persona and microphone fixes.
Original LICENSE, NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES accompany the downloaded build.
OmniRoute is downloaded from the original project's published Docker namespace,
without source modification; it retains its own license and notices.
Also includes routing examples, server/device installation and embedded recovery.
Modified source files carry notices; see docs/PROVENANCE.md.
